<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Yorkshire Water.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Yorkshire Water.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corporation has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on ordinary shares of Yorkshire Water, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    3.75 STG		  PREMIUM	16.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.38 STG		  GEARING	9.4 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   03.SEP.98		 PAYDATE	10.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  3.55 STG</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
